2026-07-27T11:22:52.0667925Z i /tmp/RtmpKMeOZf/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0668268Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0668695Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0669075Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0669630Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0670805Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:22:52.0671753Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
